<title>SRI LANKA: RESEARCH ALERT - Commercial a buy - UBS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Commercial a buy - UBS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said on Wednesday it recommended a buy on Commercial Bank Ltd, citing the bank's large corporate and trade-related customer base.</p>
<p>It said in a report that the bank was set for strong earnings growth in the next three years. &quot;It is one of the most undervalued stocks in the banking sector compelling us to recommend a buy,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The share was last traded at 105 rupees.</p>
</text>
